WEBVTT

00:07.670 --> 00:09.160
An Executioner!

00:09.160 --> 00:10.700
This really is not good.

00:10.700 --> 00:11.740
I'm coming with you!

00:12.580 --> 00:13.660
That's the second time.

00:21.960 --> 00:24.550
Executioners work in pairs.

00:24.880 --> 00:27.050
You're the other one, right?

00:30.850 --> 00:32.560
Just by seeing that...

00:33.310 --> 00:35.850
...you pulled the trigger
with no hesitation?

00:38.730 --> 00:40.080
"Out of the question", you said?

00:42.020 --> 00:44.240
You've been doubting me this whole time.

00:45.610 --> 00:47.320
Adults sure are cunning.

01:03.960 --> 01:04.970
What...

02:44.910 --> 02:50.340
(Eloquence and Silence - Epilogue)

02:59.910 --> 03:01.100
Hey.

03:03.460 --> 03:06.900
Before you die,
tell me how to break this curse.

03:07.840 --> 03:09.920
You know something about that, right?

03:10.670 --> 03:14.860
At times like these, you should say
"Tell me, and I'll help you."

03:15.090 --> 03:16.930
Just my two cents.

03:17.260 --> 03:19.530
I don't know how to help you.

03:19.850 --> 03:21.730
Besides, I'll kill you either way.

03:22.640 --> 03:25.400
If you still want an easy death,
just answer me already.

03:26.060 --> 03:28.080
I can't let that happen.

03:28.440 --> 03:31.740
There are some things you can't get
just by threatening people.

03:32.490 --> 03:35.820
You should learn
how to give in order to take.

03:35.820 --> 03:37.580
Talking all that mighty...

03:39.910 --> 03:42.260
You sure are a talker.

03:42.640 --> 03:46.670
There indeed is a way
to break a witch's curse.

03:47.420 --> 03:48.960
If you want to know,

03:49.380 --> 03:51.540
you have to fulfill my conditions.

03:52.510 --> 03:53.340
That girl...

03:54.130 --> 03:55.970
Falvell... Protect her!

03:56.650 --> 03:59.240
You're telling me to go protect a witch?

03:59.240 --> 04:00.850
It's necessary!

04:01.220 --> 04:06.600
Her existence is absolutely necessary
in order to break the curse!

04:24.000 --> 04:26.750
Hey. You sure are late.

04:27.750 --> 04:31.710
I thought you'd at least want
to say your farewells.

04:42.930 --> 04:44.020
Grab her.

04:44.490 --> 04:46.270
- B-But...
- It'll be fine.

04:46.890 --> 04:48.110
She won't fight back.

04:57.070 --> 04:58.240
You're late.

04:59.120 --> 05:01.090
Have you killed Owent?

05:01.700 --> 05:02.590
Yeah.

05:02.870 --> 05:05.620
The villagers even ignored us.

05:09.540 --> 05:12.170
Owent finally told me before he died.

05:12.630 --> 05:14.520
The reason why she can't use her powers

05:14.920 --> 05:17.340
is because of a witch's curse.

05:20.550 --> 05:23.710
It really is a witch's mark.

05:24.910 --> 05:26.170
Such a waste.

05:26.950 --> 05:29.770
We thought it might be possible
that she was just hiding her power,

05:30.200 --> 05:33.650
so we even watched her closely
undercover for half a year.

05:34.280 --> 05:35.490
What a shame.

05:36.070 --> 05:38.400
There is no way to break a witch's curse.

05:38.900 --> 05:41.740
So we can't seize Falvell's power?

05:42.280 --> 05:45.290
Yeah. All we can do is dispose of her.

05:45.580 --> 05:48.450
I wanted the Mystic Witch's power,

05:48.960 --> 05:50.140
but this leaves me no choice.

05:51.210 --> 05:54.000
But the one thing
I feel remorse about the most is...

05:55.380 --> 05:56.340
Falvell...

05:57.670 --> 06:00.510
I'll never be able to
drink your tea again.

06:06.100 --> 06:07.020
Sven.

06:07.680 --> 06:09.810
If you feel remorse about it,
we can just not execute her.

06:10.520 --> 06:13.110
Craig, the thing about tea is...

06:13.830 --> 06:17.500
...the last remaining drop
is always the most delicious.

06:19.450 --> 06:21.870
This thing I have protected
with my hands all this time,

06:22.370 --> 06:24.490
the pure, gullible,

06:25.290 --> 06:27.540
lovable Falvell...

06:28.750 --> 06:32.040
I've thoroughly enjoyed my days
as your friendly neighbor.

06:32.790 --> 06:34.000
And last, but not least...

06:34.960 --> 06:37.510
...I'd love to enjoy
tasting your last drop.

06:46.310 --> 06:48.740
"Spread hate towards witches,

06:48.740 --> 06:52.160
burn every single thing
that witches have,

06:52.560 --> 06:55.150
and cleanse evil with that sacred fire."

06:55.810 --> 06:56.820
Is that it?

06:57.570 --> 07:00.240
You really are playing it by the book,

07:00.570 --> 07:01.820
Executioners.

07:02.240 --> 07:05.070
Oh, I thought she had run away.

07:05.820 --> 07:09.350
Craig, is this
the coffin girl you mentioned?

07:09.830 --> 07:11.920
- Yeah.
- What's she doing?

07:12.170 --> 07:14.250
Did she come here to protect Falvell?

07:16.550 --> 07:19.230
Who are you?

07:24.470 --> 07:28.010
Why do you know about
the ways of Executioners?

07:28.640 --> 07:31.330
Who in the world are you?

07:34.790 --> 07:37.190
You're in the way! Get lost already!

07:37.650 --> 07:39.210
Is that a metal casket?

07:39.940 --> 07:43.130
Dragging this around...
This woman gets even odder every second.

07:43.610 --> 07:45.760
What is in there?

07:54.420 --> 07:56.430
Well, I'll deal with this woman later.

07:57.710 --> 08:00.610
Right now, I don't want anyone
interrupting my execution of Falvell.

08:03.010 --> 08:05.010
What are you doing? Run!

08:07.260 --> 08:08.760
How irritating.

08:19.520 --> 08:21.630
There's no way you can just run.

08:22.400 --> 08:23.780
Even if you want to,

08:24.110 --> 08:26.590
leaving Owent behind here
and running away

08:27.410 --> 08:30.430
wouldn't be possible for
the oh-so-kindhearted Falvell.

08:33.200 --> 08:34.410
Do you hate me?

08:35.250 --> 08:36.370
That's a first.

08:36.960 --> 08:38.850
I've never seen you make that face.

08:45.300 --> 08:49.470
Without magic, there is no way
you can run away from an Executioner.

08:50.180 --> 08:51.970
I told you that I will protect you,

08:52.720 --> 08:54.930
but it ended up like this. I'm sorry.

08:55.350 --> 08:56.520
But, Falvell...

08:57.020 --> 08:58.980
I have no choice
but to leave the rest to you.

08:59.560 --> 09:01.940
Listen. Listen really well to me...

09:12.740 --> 09:14.450
Why are you here?

09:15.000 --> 09:18.330
What did he tell you? I told you to run.

09:19.830 --> 09:22.920
You should learn
how to give in order to take.

09:25.760 --> 09:27.590
Ugh, what a pain...

09:29.340 --> 09:32.890
You must be filled
with hatred towards them, right?

09:33.890 --> 09:36.810
I'll take them down in your place.

09:38.690 --> 09:41.690
So do what I say and go!

09:41.960 --> 09:43.880
If you die,

09:43.880 --> 09:45.490
my curse will...

10:09.550 --> 10:11.650
Seems like you're in enough pain already.

10:15.350 --> 10:18.060
Killing you here and letting you rest

10:18.730 --> 10:20.120
is something I'd hate to do, but...

10:30.740 --> 10:31.610
What?

10:34.620 --> 10:36.080
What the hell are you?!

10:47.500 --> 10:49.380
What the hell are you?!

11:01.390 --> 11:02.950
Damn scum...

11:02.950 --> 11:05.330
My senses got dulled.

11:07.040 --> 11:08.400
What a surprise.

11:09.190 --> 11:11.780
I see. So this is...

11:15.280 --> 11:17.370
Why are you all just standing there?!

11:17.830 --> 11:19.580
Hurry! Grab the witch!

11:19.910 --> 11:22.160
These guys are desperate to protect her!

11:22.500 --> 11:24.040
Make her a hostage!

11:24.040 --> 11:25.930
- Right!
- Let's hurry!

11:27.810 --> 11:29.190
A hostage?

11:30.260 --> 11:31.800
She won't be one.

11:33.760 --> 11:35.280
I've gotten what I need from her.

11:35.650 --> 11:37.570
I do want my revenge,

11:37.810 --> 11:40.410
but you should watch out for yourselves!

11:41.280 --> 11:42.830
Humans, I command thee.

11:42.830 --> 11:43.910
Do not move!

11:48.020 --> 11:50.490
My body... isn't moving...

11:53.490 --> 11:54.780
Fire, I command thee.

11:55.620 --> 11:56.450
Die down.

12:02.710 --> 12:03.580
What is this...

12:04.120 --> 12:05.620
What's happening?

12:05.620 --> 12:07.920
Ah, I see...

12:08.420 --> 12:11.380
So, her body was also...

12:11.550 --> 12:13.360
...a witch's.

12:14.680 --> 12:19.930
By touching their lips to a witch's,
they broke each other's seals.

12:21.140 --> 12:23.240
You better brace yourself.

12:23.390 --> 12:26.480
She uses the most elusive vocative magic.

12:27.150 --> 12:29.120
Right now, everything in this world

12:29.400 --> 12:31.820
is at her beck and call!

12:33.990 --> 12:35.280
Executioner...

12:35.650 --> 12:36.920
W-Wait.

12:37.320 --> 12:39.120
Wait a minute, Falvell!

12:39.780 --> 12:41.640
Stop! Falvell...

12:41.640 --> 12:44.000
- ...I command thee.
- Falvell!

12:44.000 --> 12:45.360
Perish!

12:54.510 --> 12:57.380
What amazing power...

12:58.140 --> 13:00.220
Both Falvell's,

13:00.930 --> 13:03.430
and that monster's.

13:03.640 --> 13:05.770
Rather than a curse,

13:05.950 --> 13:07.690
a seal is a more fitting term.

13:09.480 --> 13:11.320
Geez.

13:11.320 --> 13:14.990
This world is... full of monsters...

13:23.830 --> 13:27.960
But it's still amazing no matter
how many times I've heard of it!

13:28.250 --> 13:30.000
Falvell's magic...

13:30.000 --> 13:33.380
It's only the next day,
but I'm back to being perfectly well!

13:33.920 --> 13:36.360
Thankfully they only stopped your heart,

13:36.360 --> 13:38.070
so we managed to bring you back.

13:38.070 --> 13:39.680
Calling that "only" is a bit...

13:40.180 --> 13:41.930
Falvell is still very young.

13:42.550 --> 13:43.890
Once she gets older,

13:44.470 --> 13:46.850
she could probably even
be able to raise the dead.

13:48.190 --> 13:49.270
Now, then.

13:49.850 --> 13:51.270
What about you?

13:51.810 --> 13:53.440
Like I've said before,

13:53.860 --> 13:58.650
breaking a spell through touching lips
with a witch is merely temporary.

13:59.320 --> 14:03.240
And breaking a curse
through that requires purity.

14:03.580 --> 14:06.660
Which means,
you can only do it once per witch.

14:09.160 --> 14:11.780
So you're left with the direct approach.

14:12.380 --> 14:14.880
You have to find the witch who cursed you.

14:15.630 --> 14:18.300
And the Order can tell you
information about witches

14:18.300 --> 14:21.900
as well as everything else
you're not aware of yet.

14:23.220 --> 14:25.640
So, what'll you do?

14:27.140 --> 14:29.640
Then, break this spell first.

14:29.640 --> 14:30.770
Spell?

14:31.310 --> 14:33.440
That weird liquid of yours.

14:33.730 --> 14:36.690
I've been so desperate to
have it again for a while now!

14:36.880 --> 14:38.460
What spell did you put on it?!

14:39.610 --> 14:43.490
I've never had this feeling before,
no matter what I eat.

14:44.080 --> 14:46.200
What did you do to my body?!

14:46.580 --> 14:48.960
If you don't want to die,
break this spell already!

14:50.100 --> 14:52.920
Could you possibly...
not understand what it is?

14:55.090 --> 14:57.840
I see. Good grief.

15:00.050 --> 15:04.640
Seems like there's a mountain's worth
of things that you still have to learn.

15:04.900 --> 15:05.810
Huh?

15:05.810 --> 15:06.990
Listen.

15:07.220 --> 15:09.930
That bizarre thing you're feeling...

15:10.390 --> 15:12.310
That's neither a spell, nor a curse.

15:12.500 --> 15:15.160
Anyone can get that feeling.

15:15.400 --> 15:19.780
If I were to put it into
words that you'd say...

15:20.450 --> 15:21.400
It'd be...

15:21.860 --> 15:23.030
..."freaking delicious".

15:33.750 --> 15:34.770
Guideau.

15:35.040 --> 15:37.340
You've got a heart of steel.

15:37.670 --> 15:41.800
It will neither bend,
nor be dyed with other people's values.

15:44.020 --> 15:46.740
Even if you somehow
get magically brainwashed,

15:46.890 --> 15:49.390
you'll push it away with
that strong sense of self of yours.

15:50.030 --> 15:53.480
Having said that, in the past three years,
you've learned a lot of things,

15:54.060 --> 15:57.480
and it has gradually changed you
according to how you wish to change.

16:01.320 --> 16:03.710
And yet, just by one encounter,

16:03.710 --> 16:05.870
you've gone back to
how you were on that day.

16:07.330 --> 16:09.330
Angela Anne Huell...

16:09.950 --> 16:11.950
What a woman full of sin.

16:14.620 --> 16:17.850
I haven't fully healed up yet,
but I can manage to move now.

16:19.420 --> 16:22.980
I still believe that this is not
a regression of all that progress,

16:23.470 --> 16:26.970
but rather, just a mere temporary tantrum.

16:27.390 --> 16:32.600
There is still something
I want to you to know most of all.

16:34.140 --> 16:35.060
Wait.

16:36.120 --> 16:37.730
The hell you mean?

16:38.020 --> 16:43.150
Do you still suspect that I'm holding back
information that would benefit you?

16:46.450 --> 16:48.320
That's not the case.

16:49.300 --> 16:51.340
It's about love, Guideau.

16:52.750 --> 16:55.910
I want you to know about love.

17:05.610 --> 17:09.700
You know that there are
eight continents in this world, right?

17:10.260 --> 17:12.820
The most influential body in the world,

17:12.970 --> 17:17.100
the Global Holy Church, has its
headquarters in the First Continent.

17:17.100 --> 17:18.100
(First Continent)

17:18.100 --> 17:20.100
Eastward from there, in order,

17:20.100 --> 17:21.190
(Second Continent)
are the Second Continent

17:21.200 --> 17:23.380
(Third Continent)
and the Third Continent.

17:24.360 --> 17:30.340
The further it is from the creator
of magic, the Global Holy Church,

17:30.670 --> 17:33.720
the less magic culture has developed.

17:34.200 --> 17:38.560
But the Eighth Continent, the furthest
away from the First Continent,

17:38.560 --> 17:41.460
has developed its own
magical tool technology.

17:42.380 --> 17:45.460
The house you live in is
in the Seventh Continent,

17:46.010 --> 17:48.220
but thanks to the Eighth Continent
right next to it,

17:48.440 --> 17:51.300
living there was quite
prosperous and comfortable, right?

17:51.990 --> 17:53.930
Either way, that aside...

17:54.720 --> 17:59.480
That's how our world is like,
but we also have several special areas.

18:00.350 --> 18:05.440
One of those is a lone island between
the Seventh and the Eighth Continent.

18:06.070 --> 18:08.000
There is an open hole there

18:08.400 --> 18:10.260
that goes deeper than
any hole in existence.

18:15.330 --> 18:19.920
No one knows where that hole leads to.

18:20.580 --> 18:22.590
At least, that's how the story goes.

18:23.000 --> 18:25.880
In reality, it's been thoroughly examined.

18:26.210 --> 18:29.420
People even offer
vacation packages to go there.

18:29.930 --> 18:32.400
That said, if you do want to travel there,

18:32.600 --> 18:34.860
you would first need
considerable power and money,

18:35.260 --> 18:38.560
as well as the readiness
to lose your life.

18:39.600 --> 18:41.870
Our Order has all of those.

18:42.400 --> 18:43.810
That's why we can go through.

18:44.690 --> 18:47.440
This is the hole that
leads to another world,

18:48.240 --> 18:49.780
the entrance down the Fall.

18:49.780 --> 18:52.630
(Fall)

18:59.910 --> 19:03.040
Thank you for your visit, Mr. Ashaf.

19:05.210 --> 19:08.010
Go ahead and proceed
through the right-hand door.

19:16.180 --> 19:19.600
There are 17 total levels of the Fall.

19:21.350 --> 19:24.480
Each level leads to a whole
different independent world.

19:27.580 --> 19:30.240
The characters Angela carved
on that Executioner...

19:32.090 --> 19:33.900
That's the alphabet used in the Fall.

19:34.780 --> 19:37.950
This is the only place
outsiders of the Fall can comprehend.

19:38.490 --> 19:41.220
If you want to pursue Angela,
either she'd be here,

19:41.220 --> 19:43.540
or there's likely
some kind of clue related to her.

19:50.420 --> 19:53.130
Welcome to Level 4.

19:53.630 --> 19:58.610
To be exact, this is
the last floor of Level 4.

19:58.970 --> 20:01.680
This level is somewhat dangerous,

20:02.180 --> 20:07.060
and being recognized as a visitor
might put you in even more danger.

20:07.520 --> 20:11.170
And so, on this floor,
we can offer you clothes to change into

20:11.320 --> 20:17.470
as well as a local coordinator
who is familiar with this level.

20:18.120 --> 20:19.510
That won't be necessary.

20:20.040 --> 20:22.160
You can just guide us
up until the changing room.

20:26.120 --> 20:28.090
How may I help you?

20:28.630 --> 20:32.710
Let's see... we would like
some middle-class clothing.

20:33.010 --> 20:35.800
We'd also like to be able to
attend upper class gatherings.

20:36.130 --> 20:37.760
Understood.

20:38.100 --> 20:42.280
We will need ten days' worth of clothes,
as well as some extra pieces.

20:42.280 --> 20:45.910
That would leave you
with a lot of luggage.

20:45.910 --> 20:49.150
I shall prepare some servants
as well as a carriage for you.

20:49.690 --> 20:50.980
And, let's see...

20:51.320 --> 20:53.260
Shall we put them inside that suitcase?

20:53.690 --> 20:56.490
No, I just need some help
with this casket.

20:57.070 --> 21:01.240
Most of it can fit inside this suitcase,

21:01.640 --> 21:04.850
but this thing has a lot of mass
and can't be compressed.

21:05.290 --> 21:06.790
Understood.

21:07.170 --> 21:09.790
And, one last request...

21:10.040 --> 21:13.210
If you have some pieces
that can cover me in black...

21:14.900 --> 21:16.800
Please give me some of those as well.

21:17.820 --> 21:21.220
But if you dress all-black
in this level...

21:21.220 --> 21:22.850
Yes, it's fine.

21:24.680 --> 21:25.850
I'm already aware.

21:27.730 --> 21:30.440
Then, please wait here for a moment.

21:32.940 --> 21:35.190
Now then, we're all set.

21:36.400 --> 21:38.240
How does it make you feel?

21:38.450 --> 21:41.160
Like I care. It's just fabric.

21:41.530 --> 21:44.490
If I can let them get torn,
they're all the same to me.

21:44.490 --> 21:46.970
Obviously,
you can't let it get dirty or torn.

21:47.160 --> 21:49.250
In that case,
it's freaking difficult to move in.

21:51.250 --> 21:54.550
Regardless of how you feel,
it suits you very well.

22:01.650 --> 22:02.740
Having said that,

22:03.230 --> 22:07.360
there is a lot of things that
can ruin your clothing here.

22:09.520 --> 22:11.340
Now, then. Shall we go?

22:13.570 --> 22:17.240
This is the Level 4, Orlencia Sett.

22:17.750 --> 22:20.510
A world populated by vampires.
